        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In recognition of the competitive environment that the Company's Installation business faces and the Union's need to provide improved job security for its members, the Company and the Union agree to implement a new Article 26 - Communication Services Installer and this Installation Job Security MOU in Installation Contract CWA-24",
