        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ACST, CST and SCST Installers who are on the active roll as of the date of signing of Installation contract CWA-24 and ACST, CST and SCST Installers recalled or hired as a result of the one-time adjustment described in paragraph 4, shall not be involuntarily laid off for the duration of Installation contract CWA-24.",
