        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) Permanent Transfer for Skill: The Company may only utilize Permanent Transfers for Skills when there is a requirement at a destination location in a specific skill category created by a long-range increase in the workload at such location which, because of skill requirements, cannot be met by hiring new employees. It is intended that the number of Permanent Transfers for Skill will be kept to a minimum.",
